---
import WorldMap from './WorldMap.astro';
---
<!-- HERO: the product, running -->
<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h">
  <div class="wrap hero-top">
    <h1 id="hero-h">Web analytics that runs in your own Cloudflare&nbsp;account.</h1>
    <div class="hero-side">
      <p class="lede">Skopia is open source and sets no cookies. One click deploys it to your account, so there is no database to look after, no consent banner, and your visitors' data stays in infrastructure you control.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="btn btn-ink" href="https://deploy.workers.cloudflare.com/?url=https://github.com/jasonm4130/skopia"><span class="key-glyph" aria-hidden="true"></span>Deploy to Cloudflare</a>
        <a class="btn-link" href="https://app.skopia.dev/share/shr_UW5RM-IF-36Nitykw3ipt40Rm17Ye0nC8v67K2JsDNs">Open the live demo <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="device" id="feed">
      <div class="device-bar">
        <span class="site mono">you.dev</span>
        <dl class="counters">
          <div><dt>Pageviews today</dt><dd class="mono odo" id="pv-count" data-value="1284">1,284</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Online now</dt><dd class="mono odo" id="online-count" data-value="7">7</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p class="sim">Simulated traffic in the real event shape. These numbers are not a claim about anyone's site.</p>
        <button class="pause" type="button" aria-pressed="false" aria-controls="feed">
          <span class="pause-ico" aria-hidden="true"></span><span class="pause-t">Pause feed</span>
        </button>
      </div>
      <div class="device-body">
        <figure class="map">
          <p class="map-read mono" id="map-read" aria-live="off"><span class="mr-k">Latest arrival</span> <span class="mr-v" id="mr-v"><b>AU</b> /pricing</span></p>
          <WorldMap />
          <figcaption>A country lights when a pageview arrives from it and fades over a minute. The collector keeps that two&#8209;letter code and nothing finer: no city, no coordinates.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="ledger">
          <div class="ledger-head mono" aria-hidden="true">
            <span>UTC</span><span>cc</span><span>path</span><span class="l-ref">referrer</span><span class="l-dev">device</span>
          </div>
          <div class="ledger-clip">
            <ol class="rows mono" id="rows" aria-label="Recent simulated events">
              <li><span>09:41:52</span><span>AU</span><span>/pricing</span><span class="l-ref">news.ycombinator.com</span><span class="l-dev">desktop</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:47</span><span>DE</span><span>/</span><span class="l-ref">(direct)</span><span class="l-dev">mobile</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:40</span><span>US</span><span>/docs/install</span><span class="l-ref">github.com</span><span class="l-dev">desktop</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:33</span><span>GB</span><span>/blog</span><span class="l-ref">google.com</span><span class="l-dev">mobile</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:29</span><span>IN</span><span>/</span><span class="l-ref">duckduckgo.com</span><span class="l-dev">desktop</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:21</span><span>JP</span><span>/changelog</span><span class="l-ref">(direct)</span><span class="l-dev">tablet</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:14</span><span>NL</span><span>/pricing</span><span class="l-ref">google.com</span><span class="l-dev">mobile</span></li>
              <li><span>09:41:06</span><span>SE</span><span>/</span><span class="l-ref">lobste.rs</span><span class="l-dev">desktop</span></li>
            </ol>
          </div>
          <p class="ledger-foot">Counted without setting a cookie.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
